{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國零售銷售表現遠高過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>美國商務部公布，9月零售銷售按月升百分之0.8，較8月低0.5個百分點，但高過市場預期的百分之0.3。主要是加油站消費增長百分之6.4的推動。</p><p></p><p>扣除汽車和汽油的核心零售銷售，9月按月上升百分之0.9，較市場預期高0.4個百分點。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T15:40:49.995395+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T16:37:42.513575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T15:38:15.776364+00:00","content_hash":"dd706f16a985e414d3247eb5a3a66756297888e0f90dba56c2d41f2825762287","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}